WEBVTT

00:03:29.836 --> 00:03:33.415
We're sometimes called the SIN countries,

00:03:33.439 --> 00:03:37.407
although our focus is very much
on the common good.

00:03:38.445 --> 00:03:41.773
And the purpose of this group
is to challenge that focus

00:03:41.797 --> 00:03:44.496
on the narrow measurement of GDP.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:48.250
To say that, yes,
economic growth matters --

00:03:48.274 --> 00:03:50.171
it is important --

00:03:50.195 --> 00:03:53.916
but it is not all that is important.

00:03:53.940 --> 00:04:00.199
And growth in GDP should not be pursued
at any or all cost.